category: Libs
requires: libssl-devel libxlsxwriter11 pkg-config zlib-devel
sdesc: "C library for creating Excel XLSX files (development)"
ldesc: "Libxlsxwriter is a C library that can be used to write text, numbers, formulas
and hyperlinks to multiple worksheets in an Excel 2007+ XLSX file."
external-source: libxlsxwriter

